'''Honeyto-kun''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and can be obtained during the [[Honey Toast Café Akihabara Collaboration Event|Honey Toast Café Akihabara]] collaboration event.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 398
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Honeyto-kun
|name2 = Honeyto-kun & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Honeyto-kun & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Honeyto is more or less a weaker [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]], the only differences being an additional knockback and higher cooldown. These weaknesses make Honeyto worse at tanking Aliens due to low endurance and replaceability. While it may be fine early into [[Into the Future]] regardless, it may as well be enemy feed most of the time, both literally and figuratively. A lack of [[Immune to Warp]] too helps nothing, as such an ability becomes a common occurrence with Alien enemies starting with [[Cats of the Cosmos]].

